{"id":"0517fc365e0749bc","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision.md","title":"Truth and Provability of Constant Arithmetical Sentences","display":"cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision — Truth and Provability of Constant Arithmetical Sentences","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision","aliases":["89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision — Truth and Provability of Constant Arithmetical Sentences","depends_on":["[[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]]","[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]","[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision — Truth and Provability of Constant Arithmetical Sentences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c45e0059ab7065e5\" href=\"?note=c45e0059ab7065e5\" title=\"89-thm-letterless-normal-form\">89-thm-letterless-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" href=\"?note=4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" title=\"89-df-letterless-trace\">89-df-letterless-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"77b58358ab49cf8f\" href=\"?note=77b58358ab49cf8f\" title=\"89-thm-lob-theorem\">89-thm-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}(A)=(e,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{tc}(A)=(e,E)\\)</span> 为有限/余有限迹码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\\)</span> 为标准真值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 为 PA 可证句子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow e=1,\\\\\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(e,E)=(1,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow e=1,\\\\\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(e,E)=(1,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 93–97；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>在标准可靠性下，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\Box^k\\bot)\">\\(\\tau(\\Box^k\\bot)\\)</span> 都假：底假；若下一个可证性断言真，PA 有前一句的证明，可靠性会使前一句真，矛盾。因此每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(R_i)\">\\(\\tau(R_i)\\)</span> 假，有限析取正规形假，余有限合取正规形真。GL 等价经算术可靠性给真值结论。\n满迹的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 GL 定理，因此翻译可证。有限迹的翻译假，由标准可靠性不可证。余有限但缺失 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 时，翻译若可证，会推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\to\\Box^i\\bot)\">\\(\\tau(\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\to\\Box^i\\bot)\\)</span>，即某个句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\tau(\\Box^i\\bot)\">\\(S=\\tau(\\Box^i\\bot)\\)</span> 的反射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner})\\to S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner})\\to S\\)</span>。Löb 定理会推出假句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 可证，矛盾。此证明不依赖全称 Solovay 反模型构造，正是原书无字母特殊情形。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"c45e0059ab7065e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-letterless-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4f8d035bfd71a4ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical","status":"resolved","id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tc}(A)=(e,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow e=1,\\\\\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&\\Longleftrightarrow(e,E)=(1,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau(\\Box^k\\bot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(R_i)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\to\\Box^i\\bot)","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\tau(\\Box^i\\bot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner})\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2085,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["c45e0059ab7065e5","4f8d035bfd71a4ab","1f581262c09d5e34","0ce064881a79d6f7","ab8391d7623da45d","77b58358ab49cf8f","8f382173effd5662"]}